From Yichen Star District, Hong came with two people;
The Demon Clan’s Changming Supreme, and the Star Spirit Clan’s Panli Supreme.
The former was recommended by the Demon Clan because of his friendship with Chu Yuan, while the latter was convinced by many supreme beings of the Star Spirit Clan because of his strong strength.
The void twisted, and a space passage emerged;
Hong nodded to the two people behind him and said, "Go ahead, Chu Yuan is waiting for you."
"Hong, you come too."
Hong was stunned for a moment, then stepped into the space passage;
But there was no pomp and no one greeted them. Only a ray of jade guided the three of them.
Walking along the beacon, not long after, I saw Chu Yuan walking from the void;
At this time, with the help of the Yinsi, the will of the universe provided by the tomb in his Daoguo has been refined to sixty-seven percent, giving Hong and the others a sense of sanctity;
It seems that we are facing the sea of origin of laws...
A few people didn't know what was going on, but they were secretly frightened, not knowing how far Chu Yuan had come together.
“I’ve called you here today, and I think you know the reason why I’m here;
But it was for the expansion of the underworld. "
Hong Ziran remained silent;
Changming and Panli looked at each other, and finally Changming said: "With the great power of Your Excellency Chu Yuan, I am willing to talk to you in a good way;
Logically speaking, we should obey orders;
It’s just that the clan has many concerns..."
Chu Yuan chuckled: "I am also aware of your difficulties, but today I am just trying to eliminate your worries."
He raised his foot forward, and the void moved with it;
Ling Hong and the others arrived in an open area.
There are no substantial objects in it, but it is densely packed with sleeping souls;
A picture is suspended in the sky, emitting five colors of light, seeming to soothe... At the same time, more souls emerge from it.
Supreme Panli was moved: "This is..."
“It is the creatures of the second era;
I have an appointment with those who are aligned with me and will send them to reincarnation. "Chu Yuandao: "Today I can also make an agreement with you two that the reincarnation of the underworld will not be partial because of the ethnic group! "
Changming's heart moved;
In fact, the demon clan has a good impression of Chu Yuan because of his return of soul blood.
At least his behavior is not overbearing and unreasonable.
Now, he can even tolerate weirdness...
What's more, it's a demon clan that belongs to the same era and had a comrade-in-arms relationship?
Chu Yuan added: "However, I also know that empty words cannot reassure you;
I was born as a human being, so it is inevitable that I will be a little partial to humans.
But the law of heaven should be impartial;
